            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides a summary of the types of congenital atrioventricular block and the various acquired diseases in which atrioventricular block may occur. Some lesions found in atrioventricular block are illustrated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
